problem_statement:
Error on installing DWM due to X11
## Describe the bug
When installing DWM-Titus on POP OS it seems it does not install X11  libraries or it does not detect them on build. It also says that the distro is not supported when ubuntu and debian are. This is my first issue, so if there's anything I can improve or info that I should provide, feel free to tell me.
Here's my fastfetch output for context:
```
